admission, STAT results obtained in 2023, 2022 or 2021 can be considered).</p><p><strong>Experience Based Entry</strong></p><p>If you are currently in Year 12 and completing the ATAR, General, VET, or Enabling pathway, you may be eligible to secure a place at Notre Dame University through experience based entry. Mature age applicants can apply by combining their academic background with relevant work experience. See <a data-outlook-id="3f0d5730-8cbb-499c-baa5-77bdcb3287ad" href="https://www.notredame.edu.au/study/applications-and-admissions/pathways/experience-based-entry" title="Experience Based Entry">Experience Based Entry</a> for further details.</p> </div> </div>',
